        en: 'main stayed on c1 while dev advanced to c2: we copied the pointer\u2019s value in the branching line, then moved only one copy. The new commit still connects because c2\u2019s parent field recorded where dev pointed at commit time — history is a graph of links, not copied folders. That is exactly what git branch and git commit do on your own machine — our model exposes their abstract machinery.',
